# Python bytecode from bench/. Absent until 0.1.1, which is how three .pyc
# files got committed: `npm run bench` writes bench/__pycache__/, a later
# `git add -A` swept it in, and nothing here said no. They shipped nowhere --
# .npmignore is an allowlist and .vscodeignore excludes bench/** -- but they
# made every bench run dirty the working tree.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
